<title>USA: Kinetic says acquisition to be accretive.</title>
<headline>Kinetic says acquisition to be accretive.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinetic Concepts Inc said on Monday the acquisition of the assets of H.F. Systems Inc would be &quot;slightly accretive&quot; to earnings in the first year.</p>
<p>The company said H.F. Systems will strengthen its position in California's high-growth extended care market but did not provide further details of the acquisition.</p>
<p>Kinetic Concepts makes therapeutic systems that address skin breakdown, circulatory problems, and pulmonary complications associated with patient immobility.</p>
